    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests {@link DurationUtils#getNanosOfMilli(Duration)}. <p> {@code getNanosOfMilli} returns the sub-millisecond portion of a duration's nanosecond field, i.e. {@code duration.getNano() % 1_000_000}. The result is therefore always in the range 0 to 999,999, and a {@code null} duration is treated as {@link Duration#ZERO}. </p>"
